  "slug": "plate-in-story",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1782_plate-in-story.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "One day, a mother and her daughter were washing the dishes while the father and son watched TV. Suddenly, they heard a plate break. The son looked at his father and said, “Mom must have broken it.” “How do you know?” his father asked. The son replied, “Yesterday, I broke a plate, and Mom was very upset. But today, she hasn’t scolded anyone.”"
  ],
  "english_full": "One day, a mother and her daughter were washing the dishes while the father and son watched TV. Suddenly, they heard a plate break. The son looked at his father and said, “Mom must have broken it.” “How do you know?” his father asked. The son replied, “Yesterday, I broke a plate, and Mom was very upset. But today, she hasn’t scolded anyone.”",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Одна́жды ма́ма и её до́чка мы́ли посу́ду, пока́ ба́тя и сын смотри́ли ТВ. Вдруг они́ услыша́ли, как таре́лка разбо́рлась. Сын посмотре́л на ба́тю и ска́зал: «Мама́, на́верняка, сло́мала её.» «Как ты зна́ешь?» спра́шивает ба́тя. Сын отве́чает: «Вче́ра я сло́мал таре́лку, и мама́ была́ о́чень огорче́нная. Но сегóдня она́ никого́ не бра́нила.»"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Odnázhdy máma i yéyo dóchka mýli posúdu, pokó bátya i syn smotríli TV. Vdrug oní uslýshali, kak tarélka razbórlas'. Syn posmotrel na bátyu i skázal: «Mámá, návernaka, slómala yéy.» «Kak ty znáesh?» spráshivaet bátya. Syn otvéchayet: «Vchéra ya slómal tarélku, i mámá bylá óchen' ogorchénnaya. No segódnya oná nikogó ne bránila.»"
  ],
